        <mxCell id="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-19" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse the organization&#39;s strategy and architecture&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Develop and agree the infrastructure and platform management approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review the infrastructure and platform management approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the infrastructure and platform management practice is to oversee the infrastructure and platforms used by an organization. When carried out properly, this practice enables the monitoring of technology solutions available to the organization, including the technology and external service providers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to align with the enterprises architectural strategy and extend/adapt it where necessary, in order to maintain a harmonized IT architecture.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Infrastructure and Platform Management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-18" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
