actice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20On-demand%20information%20discovery%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;management&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Monitoring planning" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4981.75" y="6089" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5073" y="8000" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s-qbUJ5rrHLjZnUm8olo-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Defining the objective of monitoring&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Assessing measurements available and criteria to be monitored&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Defining types of events for the object of monitoring&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Defining the thresholds for different type of events&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Defining a service &#39;health model (end-to-end events)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Defining events correlations and rule sets&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Mapping events with action plans and functions responsible and notified&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the monitoring and event management practice is to systematically observe services and services components, and record and report selected changes of state identified as events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to set up a central monitoring for the projects IT infrastructure, in order to collect all logs and enable the enterprise to detect events.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Monitoring and event management&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.2)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="s-qbUJ5rrHLjZnUm8olo-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.14&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Information transfer" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5397.25" y="6088" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="12810" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Information transfer rules, procedures, or agreements should be in place for all types of transfer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;facilities within the organization and between the organization and other parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To maintain the security of information transferred within an organization and with any external&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;interested party.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow rules, procedures or agreements for information transfer within or between organizations, in order to protect information in transit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.5&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Secure authentication" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5756" y="6088" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="13980" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Secure authentication technologies and procedures should be implemented based on information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;access restrictions and the topic-specific policy on access control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure a user or an entity is securely authenticated, when access to systems, applications and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;services is granted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure secure authentication for information and functionalities based on information access restrictions and topic-specific policy on access control, in order to ensure a user or entity is securely authenticated, when accessing systems, applications and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
