        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-10" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain a configuration management repository and create controlled configuration baselines.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Provide sufficient information about service assets to enable the service to be effectively managed. Assess the impact of changes and deal with service incidents.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want an up-to-date configuration management where also projects integrate their configuration items (CI) as well as establish a configuration baseline, in order to maintain an overview on the enterprises configuration and establish a valuable information sources for other service processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI10.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
