ed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;management&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Managing the IT asset life cycle and records" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4980.5" y="5999" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5073" y="2620" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jNRMRp2S-dL0ja43aLe--10" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse resources and identify IT assets&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Verify IT assets and lifecycle models&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Follow the lifecycle model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Manage exceptions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review the lifecycle&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the IT asset management practice is to plan and manage the full lifecycle of all IT assets, to help the organization: maximize value, control costs, manage risks, support decision-making, meet regulatory and contractual requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to record all IT assets in line with the enterprises methodology, in order to maintain a complete overview of the enterprise&#39;s IT assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;IT asset&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;management (3.2.3)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="jNRMRp2S-dL0ja43aLe--9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-1" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.13&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Labelling of information" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5397.25" y="5998" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="12720" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;An appropriate set of procedures for information labelling should be developed and implemented in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;accordance with the information classification scheme adopted by the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To facilitate the communication of classification of information and support automation of information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;processing and management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to label processed and stored information, in order to attach the classification of information directly to it and support automated processing and management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-7" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.3&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Information access restriction" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5754.25" y="5998" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428.75" y="13890" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-8" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Access to information and other associated assets should be restricted in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;established topic-specific policy on access control.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure only authorized access and to prevent unauthorized access to information and other&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;associated assets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to design and implement proper information access restriction within the implemented solution, in order to ensure only authorized access to information and other associated assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
