ement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;management (3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Release coordination" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4991.25" y="4099" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="8090" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Identification of applicable model or plan&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Verification of the service components&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Verification of the release procedures&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Release execution&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Release verification&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Release review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the release management practice is to make new and changed services and features available for use.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to apply coordination practices of the enterprise within their releases, in order to maintain an adequate level of service quality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oTJ3HsHo-e2HUiJ0V5Zs-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.30&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  ICT readiness for business continuity" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.75" y="4088" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="8640" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oTJ3HsHo-e2HUiJ0V5Zs-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;ICT readiness should be planned, implemented, maintained and tested based on business continuity objectives and ICT continuity requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;To ensure the availability of the organization’s information and other associated assets during disruption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to consider continuity requirements of the solution to plan, impalement, maintain and test ICT readiness, in order to ensure availability of the solution during disruptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="oTJ3HsHo-e2HUiJ0V5Zs-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-9" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.8&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Management of technical vulnerabilities" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5751.75" y="4088" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5434.25" y="10350" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-10" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Information about technical vulnerabilities of information systems in use should be obtained, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization’s exposure to such vulnerabilities should be evaluated and appropriate measures should&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;be taken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To prevent exploitation of technical vulnerabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to onboard their project infrastructure as well as the newly introduced infrastructure by the project to the organizations vulnerability management process, in order to enable early detection and therefore prevent exploitation of technical vulnerabilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-12" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Capacity/performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3