        <mxCell id="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Identifying service availability requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Agreeing service availability requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Determining availability measurements requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Designing availability metrics and reports&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the availability management practice is to ensure that services deliver the agreed levels of availability to meet the needs of the customers and users.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects identify service availability requirements and set up a quantitative measuring and reporting, in order to maintain an adequate level of availability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Availability management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Availability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;management (3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Analysing and improving service availability" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4991.25" y="3829" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428" y="2530" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Service availability analysis&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Reporting service availability&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Planning and designing service availability&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the availability management practice is to ensure that services deliver the agreed levels of availability to meet the needs of the customers and users.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to analyze the solutions availability and adapt availability settings respectively, in order to maintain an adequate level of availability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wldCwMX5vw_F5R4HQKtS-5" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.22&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Monitoring, review and change management of supplier services" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.25" y="3818" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="8370" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wldCwMX5vw_F5R4HQKtS-6" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The organization should regularly monitor, review, evaluate and manage change in supplier information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;security practices and service delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To maintain an agreed level of information security and service delivery in line with supplier&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;agreements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects not to perform directly monitoring or review activities, but to assure that new services providers - on-bordered during the project phase -&amp;nbsp; are included in the enterprises monitoring, review and change management mechanisms, in order to assure a tight supplier steering and management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="wldCwMX5vw_F5R4HQKtS-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-1" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.4&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Access to source code" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750.5" y="3818" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="4510" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Read and write access to source code, development tools and software libraries should be appropriately&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;managed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To prevent the introduction of unauthorized functionality, avoid unintentional or malicious changes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and to maintain the confidentiality of valuable intellectual property.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to restrict read and write access to source code, development tools and libraries, in order to prevent unauthorized changes of the solution and maintain the confidentiality of valuable intellectual property.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="APiUFab89vncxG1K5Xg5-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-12" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Workforce and talent management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Organizational planning" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4270" y="3739" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428" y="2630" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-13" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Strategic analysis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Service value chain analysis&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Organizational design&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Initiating and monitoring organizational changes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Organization monitoring and review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the workforce and talent management practice is to ensure that the organization has the right people, with the appropriate skills and knowledge, in the correct roles to support ist business objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to plan organizational changes caused by the project in line with the enterprise&#39;s practices, in order to align with the enterprise&#39;s framework.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Workforce and talent management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-12" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-14" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Workforce and talent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;management&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Employees&#39; journey management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4630" y="3739" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5071.75" y="5730" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-15" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Segment the workforce and identify the employee journey model&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Verify and adjust the employee journey model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Follow the model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Manage exceptions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review the journey&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the workforce and talent management practice is to ensure that the organization has the right people, with the appropriate skills and knowledge, in the correct roles to support ist business objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to manage the employee journey within the scope of the project in line with enterprise&#39;s practices, in order create a similar experience for the entire workforce of the enterprise.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Workforce and talent management (3.2.3)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-14" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-16" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Workforce and talent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;management&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.3)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Talent management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4990" y="3739" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5431.75" y="5730" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-17" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Defining a competency vision&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Competency assessment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Planning development and optimization&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Steering the development programme&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Managing exceptions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Competency development programme review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the workforce and talent management practice is to ensure that the organization has the right people, with the appropriate skills and knowledge, in the correct roles to support ist business objectives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to define necessary competencies, plan the development of those and steer them, in order make all necessary competences for the project available.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-13" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.19&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Information security in supplier relationships" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.75" y="3728" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="8280" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-14" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Processes and procedures should be defined and implemented to manage the information security&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;risks associated with the use of supplier’s products or services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To maintain an agreed level of information security in supplier relationships.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow enterprise&#39;s processes and procedures of managing the information security risk associated with the use of externally provided services, in order to maintain a level of information security in supplier relationships.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.1&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  User endpoint devices" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750.5" y="3728" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="13800" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Information stored on, processed by or accessible via user endpoint devices should be protected.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;To protect information against the risks introduced by using user endpoint devices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure protection of information stored on, processed by or accessed via user endpoint devices within project scope or used by the project, in order to protect information against the risks introduced by using user endpoint devices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-8" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Supplier management&lt;/i&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Managing supplier journeys" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4990" y="3649" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5431.75" y="5640" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-9" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Identifying available suppliers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Engaging with suppliers and communicating demand&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Evaluating and selecting suppliers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Contracting suppliers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- On / offboarding suppliers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Managing consumption and monitoring supplier performance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Assessing and reviewing suppliers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the supplier management practice is to ensure that the organization&#39;s suppliers and their performances are managed appropriately to support the seamless provision of quality products and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to manage their suppliers on a continuous basis in a sufficient manner, in order to manage their performance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-8" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-7" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.16&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Identity management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5392.5" y="3638" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5431.25" y="8190" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-8" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The full life cycle of identities should be managed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To allow for the unique identification of individuals and systems accessing the organization’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;information and other associated assets and to enable appropriate assignment of access rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow the enterprise&#39;s identity management approach, in order to enable the unique identification of individuals and systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="s3o6-SQ5s5fYGSt-Lbuv-7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-1" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 7.14&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Secure disposal or re-use of equipment" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750.5" y="3638" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="9900" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Items of equipment containing storage media should be verified to ensure that any sensitive data and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;licensed software has been removed or securely overwritten prior to disposal or re-use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To prevent leakage of information from equipment to be disposed or re-used.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure secure disposal or re-use of equipment used during the project phase and to assure that newly introduced equipment by the project are managed according to the organization&#39;s secure disposal processes, in order to prevent leakage of information from equipment to be disposed or re-used.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="Esgi7Jmj60HRl2v-kxbO-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NjYFKYjcXnlCeQA4j0BC-9" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Risk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;management (3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Risk identification, analysis, and treatment" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4991.25" y="3559" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5073" y="2170" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NjYFKYjcXnlCeQA4j0BC-10" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Risk identification,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Risk analysis and evaluation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Risk treatment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the risk management practice is to ensure that the organization understands and effectively handles risks. Managing risk is essential to ensuring the ongoing sustainability of an organization and co-creating value for its customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to identify, analyze, evaluate and treat risks within the context of the project, in order to properly manage the enterprise&#39;s risk exposure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Risk&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;management (3.2.3)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="NjYFKYjcXnlCeQA4j0BC-9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-30" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.11&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Return of assets" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5394.25" y="3548" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="8100" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-31" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Personnel and other interested parties as appropriate should return all the organization’s assets in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;their possession upon change or termination of their employment, contract or agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To protect the organization’s assets as part of the process of changing or terminating employment,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;contract or agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure that organization&#39;s assets in the possession of personnel or other interested parties are returned after the termination of their assignment to the project, in order to protect organization&#39;s assets in scope of the project and assure a need-to-know principle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-30" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-17" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 7.13&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Equipment maintenance" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750.5" y="3548" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="9810" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-18" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Equipment should be maintained correctly to ensure availability, integrity and confidentiality of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To prevent loss, damage, theft or compromise of information and other associated assets and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;interruption to the organization’s operations caused by lack of maintenance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure correct maintenance of equipment after the go-live, in order to prevent loss, damage, theft or compromise of information and other associated assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-17" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-43" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Project&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;management (3.2.3)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Managing projects" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4991.25" y="3469" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5073" y="1990" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-44" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Starting up a project&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Initiating a project&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Controlling a stage&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Managing a stage boundary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Closing a project&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the project management practice is to ensure that all projects in the organization are successfully delivered. This is achieved by planning, delegating, monitoring, and maintaining control of all aspects of a project, and ensuring motivation for the people involved.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, want agile solution development projects to follow the organization&#39;s approach to manage projects, in order to follow an organization-wide homogeneous approach or at least remain within the set boundaries.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Project management (3.2.4)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-43" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-22" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.7&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Threat intelligence" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5394.25" y="3458" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="8010" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-23" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Information relating to information security threats should be collected and analyzed to produce threat&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;intelligence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;To provide awareness of the organization’s threat environment so that the appropriate mitigation&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;actions can be taken.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to establish a processes on how to work with threat intelligence information as well as analyze and distribute them within the project structure, in order to understand the organization&#39;s threat environment and mitigate risks already in the development phase.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-22" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-15" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 7.12&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Cabling security" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750.5" y="3458" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="9720" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-16" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Cables carrying power, data or supporting information services should be protected from interception,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;interference or damage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To prevent loss, damage, theft or compromise of information and other associated assets and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;interruption to the organization’s operations related to power and communications cabling.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow or adapt cabling security requirements for cables carrying power, data or supporting information services, in order to protect against interception, interference or damage and cause loss, damage, theft or compromise of information or associated assets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-15" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-37" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Portfolio management (3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Managing the organization&#39;s approach to portfolios" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4991.25" y="3379" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5073" y="7550" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-38" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse the organization&#39;s strategy and resources&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Develop and agree the portfolio management approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Develop and agree the portfolio management models for different portfolio groups and categories&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Communicate the portfolio management approach and models to key stakeholder groups&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review and adjust the portfolio management approach and models&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the portfolio management practice is to ensure that the organization has the right mix of programs, projects, products, and services to execute the organization&#39;s strategy within its funding and resource constraints.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, want agile solution development projects to work according to the organizations approach to portfolios, in order to maintain a consistent overview.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Portfolio management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-37" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-12" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.2&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Information security roles and responsibilities" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5393.75" y="3368" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5432.5" y="7920" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-13" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Information security roles and responsibilities should be defined and allocated according to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;To establish a defined, approved and understood structure for the implementation, operation and&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;management of information security within the organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to establish all required roles and responsibilities within the project and production phase, in order to establish an maintain a sufficient governance on security and adequate management of security processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-12" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-13" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 7.11&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Supporting utilities" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750" y="3368" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5432.5" y="9630" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-14" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Information processing facilities should be protected from power failures and other disruptions caused&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;by failures in supporting utilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To prevent loss, damage or compromise of information and other associated assets, or interruption to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;the organization’s operations due to failure and disruption of supporting utilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow or adapt requirements for supporting utilities serving information processing facilities, in order to prevent loss, damage or compromise of information, assets or any other operational disruption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-23" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.32&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Change management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6110" y="3368" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5434.25" y="11340" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-24" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Changes to information processing facilities and information systems should be subject to change&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;management procedures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To preserve information security when executing changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to comply with change management procedures, in order to preserve information security when executing changes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-23" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-18" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Measurement and reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;(3.2.2)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Reporting and evaluating" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4991.25" y="3289" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="1810" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-19" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Data gathering and processing&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Data analysis and reporting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Report evaluation and decision-making&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the measurement and reporting practice is to support good decision-making and continual improvement by decreasing the levels of uncertainty. This is achieved through the collection of relevant data on various managed objects and the valid assessment of this data in an appropriate context.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to gather and process data in order to analyze and report sufficiently to the management, in order to keep the management well-informed for appropriate decision-taking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nB1jEptSUxtJqMZ95UXG-18" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-10" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 5.1&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Policies for information security" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5393.75" y="3278" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430.5" y="2890" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-11" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Information security policy and topic-specific policies should be defined, approved by management,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;published, communicated to and acknowledged by relevant personnel and relevant interested parties,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and reviewed at planned intervals and if significant changes occur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;To ensure continuing suitability, adequacy, effectiveness of management direction and support&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;for information security in accordance with business, legal, statutory, regulatory and contractual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to familiarize themselves with the information security policy framework, in order to assure compliance of the final solution as well as in the development process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="bgYUZ9FqRBf7vEnh27Lf-10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-11" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 7.10&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Storage media" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5750" y="3278" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5432.5" y="9540" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-12" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Storage media should be managed through their life cycle of acquisition, use, transportation and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;disposal in accordance with the organization’s classification scheme and handling requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure only authorized disclosure, modification, removal or destruction of information on storage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;media.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow or adapt protection requirements for storage media through their life cycle, in order to prevent unauthorized disclosure, modification, removal or destruction of storage media.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="xloykYCow0mXDYhp3S2N-11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-7" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.24&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Use of cryptography" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6110" y="3278" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5434.25" y="11250" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-8" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Rules for the effective use of cryptography, including cryptographic key management, should be defined&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure proper and effective use of cryptography to protect the confidentiality, authenticity or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;integrity of information according to business and information security requirements, and taking into&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;consideration legal, statutory, regulatory and contractual requirements related to cryptography.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to comply with the organization&#39;s rules for effective use of cryptography and key management, in order to ensure proper and effective use of cryptography to protect the confidentiality, authenticity or integrity of information according to business and information security requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-98" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;DSS04.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Maintain business resilience." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="2388" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5073" y="1540" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-99" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Evaluate business resilience options and choose a cost-effective and viable strategy that will ensure enterprise continuity, disaster recovery and incident response in the face of a disaster or other major incident or disruption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Adapt rapidly, continue business operations and maintain availability of resources and information at a level acceptable to the enterprise in the event of a significant disruption (e.g., threats, opportunities, demands).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to evaluate business resilience option and continuity strategies, in order to maintain a resilient enterprise.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: DSS04.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-98" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-100" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;DSS04.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Develop and implement a business continuity response." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="2388" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5433" y="1540" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-101" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Develop a business continuity plan (BCP) and disaster recovery plan (DRP) based on the strategy. Document all procedures necessary for the enterprise to continue critical activities in the event of an incident.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Adapt rapidly, continue business operations and maintain availability of resources and information at a level acceptable to the enterprise in the event of a significant disruption (e.g., threats, opportunities, demands).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want all solutions that are critical to my business to have current BCP and DRP documented, in order to have executable plans right from day 1 of operation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: DSS04.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-100" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-102" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-98" target="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-100" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3500" y="2308" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3560" y="2308" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-15" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI11.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Maintain a standard approach for project management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="2298" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="2550" y="2000" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-16" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Maintain a standard approach for project management that enables governance and management review, decision-making and delivery management activities. These activities should focus consistently on business value and goals (i.e., requirements, risk, costs, schedule and quality targets).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize defined project outcomes and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion by improving communications to and involvement of business and end users. Ensure the value and quality of project deliverables and maximize their contribution to the defined programs and investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects follow the established standard principles of project management, in order to make projects comparable and manageable from an enterprise perspective.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI11.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-15" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-17" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI11.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Start up and initiate a project." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="2298" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="2910" y="2000" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-18" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Define and document the nature and scope of the project to confirm and develop a common understanding of project scope among stakeholders. The definition should be formally approved by the project sponsors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize defined project outcomes and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion by improving communications to and involvement of business and end users. Ensure the value and quality of project deliverables and maximize their contribution to the defined programs and investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want a documented start and initiation of a project with a formal project sponsor approval, in order to develop a common understanding of the project scope among stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI11.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-17" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-19" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-15" target="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-17" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2780" y="2308" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2840" y="2308" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-26" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI11.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Manage stakeholder engagement." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="2298" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3270" y="2000" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-27" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Manage stakeholder engagement to ensure an active exchange of accurate, consistent and timely information that reaches all relevant stakeholders. This includes planning, identifying and engaging stakeholders and managing their expectations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize defined project outcomes and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion by improving communications to and involvement of business and end users. Ensure the value and quality of project deliverables and maximize their contribution to the defined programs and investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects - even though stakeholder engagement is integral to the methodology - to involve stakeholders properly, in order to meet the needs of all involved parties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI11.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-26" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-41" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-17" target="QuHqFJcRldl6wBvhqh9c-26" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3490" y="2298" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3200" y="2308" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-100" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-103" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-101" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2420" y="2218" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2480" y="2218" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-101" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI05.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Form an effective implementation team." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="2208" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3630" y="4230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-102" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish an effective implementation team by assembling appropriate members, creating trust, and establishing common goals and effectiveness measures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Prepare and commit stakeholders for business change and reduce the risk of failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to form and assemble effective implementation teams, in order to create trust, establish common goals and develop effective measures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI05.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-101" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-103" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI05.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Establish the desire to change." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2470" y="2208" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3270" y="4230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-104" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Understand the scope and impact of the desired change. Assess stakeholder readiness and willingness to change. Identify actions that will motivate stakeholder acceptance and participation to make the change work successfully.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Prepare and commit stakeholders for business change and reduce the risk of failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile projects to assess the stakeholder&#39;s readiness and willingness to change, in order to establish a desire to change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI05.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-103" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-105" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-101" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-114" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2770" y="2208" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2830" y="2208" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-109" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI05.04&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Empower role players and identify short-term wins." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="2208" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="2490" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-110" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Empower those with implementation roles by assigning accountability. Provide training and align organizational structures and HR processes. Identify and communicate short-term wins that are important from a change-enablement perspective.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Prepare and commit stakeholders for business change and reduce the risk of failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want role models to be empowered and identify short-term wins, in order to drive the change and stuff it with resources.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI05.05&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-109" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-114" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI05.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Communicate desired vision." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="2208" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3990" y="4230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-115" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Communicate the desired vision for the change in the language of those affected by it. The communication should be made by senior management and include the rationale for, and benefits of, the change; the impacts of not making the change; and the vision, the road map and the involvement required of the various stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Prepare and commit stakeholders for business change and reduce the risk of failure.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development project to communicate and promote the desired vision, in order to establish a desire to change with the stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI05.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-114" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-116" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-114" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-109" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3140.5" y="2218" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3200.5" y="2218" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-55" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - BAI03.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Design high-level solutions." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="2118" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="1467.5" y="2540" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-56" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Develop and document high-level designs for the solution in terms of technology, business processes and workflows. Use agreed and appropriate phased or rapid Agile development techniques. Ensure alignment with the I&amp;amp;T strategy and enterprise architecture. Reassess and update the designs when significant issues occur during detailed design or building phases, or as the solution evolves. Apply a user-centric approach; ensure that stakeholders actively participate in the design and approve each version.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Ensure agile and scalable delivery of digital products and services. Establish timely and cost-effective solutions (technology, business processes and workflows) capable of supporting enterprise strategic and operational objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want a high-level solution to be designed, in order to involve all necessary counterparties as well as align on a common setting.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI03.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-55" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-1" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-4" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-2" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="980" y="2038" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1040" y="2038" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-2" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Initiate a program." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1390" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="2902.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-3" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Initiate a program to confirm expected benefits and obtain authorization to proceed. This includes agreeing on program sponsorship, confirming the program mandate through approval of the conceptual business case, appointing program board or committee members, producing the program brief, reviewing and updating the business case, developing a benefits realization plan, and obtaining approval from sponsors to proceed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want a clear initiation of a program, in order to assign clear roles and establish a solid framework.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-4" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - BAI01.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Maintain a standard approach for program management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1030" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="2542.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-5" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Maintain a standard approach for program management that enables governance and management review, decision-making and delivery management activities. These activities should focus consistently on business value and goals (i.e., requirements, risk, costs, schedule and quality targets).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want even agile solution development projects to follow a standardized and homogeneous approach, in order to assure a certain quality and control mechanisms.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-6" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Manage stakeholder engagement." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3262.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-7" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Manage stakeholder engagement to ensure an active exchange of accurate, consistent and timely information for all relevant stakeholders. This includes planning, identifying and engaging stakeholders and managing their expectations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want stakeholders to be involved, in order to assure that the deliverables meet their requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-8" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.04&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Develop and maintain the program plan." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2110" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3622.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-9" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Formulate a program to lay the initial groundwork. Position it for successful execution by formalizing the scope of the work and identifying deliverables that will satisfy goals and deliver value. Maintain and update the program plan and business case throughout the full economic life cycle of the program, ensuring alignment with strategic objectives and reflecting the current status and insights gained to date.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want to have a maintained program plan, in order to ensure an alignment with strategic objectives and get an understanding of the project schedule.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.05&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-8" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-10" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-2" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-6" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1690" y="2028" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1750" y="2028" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-11" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-6" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-8" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1700" y="2038" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1760" y="2038" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-12" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-15" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-13" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2780" y="2038" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2840" y="2038" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-13" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.07&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Manage program quality." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4702.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-14" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Prepare and execute a quality management plan, processes and practices that align with quality management standards (QMS). Describe the approach to program quality and implementation. The plan should be formally reviewed and agreed on by all parties concerned and incorporated into the integrated program plan.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want to have a quality management plan executed, in order to align the program with quality management standards.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.08&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-15" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.06&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Monitor, control and report on the program outcomes." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4342.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-16" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Monitor and control performance against plan throughout the full economic life cycle of the investment, covering solution delivery at the program level and value/outcome at the enterprise level. Report performance to the program steering committee and the sponsors&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want programs to be monitored, controlled and reported, in order to assure an adequate quality and maintain a necessary oversight on the program.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.07&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-15" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-17" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.08&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Manage program risk." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="2310" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-18" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Eliminate or minimize specific risk associated with programs through a systematic process of planning, identifying, analyzing, responding to, monitoring and controlling the areas or events with the potential to cause unwanted change. Define and record any risk faced by program management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want risks to be managed, in order to assure the anticipation of adverse events and the maintenance of counter measures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.09&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-17" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-21" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-13" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-17" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3490" y="2028" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3550" y="2028" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-23" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;BAI01.05&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Launch and execute the program." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2470" y="2028" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3982.5" y="2970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-24" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Launch and execute the program to acquire and direct the resources needed to accomplish the goals and benefits of the program as defined in the program plan. In accordance with stage-gate or release review criteria, prepare for stage-gate, iteration or release reviews to report progress and make the case for funding up to the following stage-gate or release review.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Realize desired business value and reduce the risk of unexpected delays, costs and value erosion. To do so, improve communications to and involvement of business and end users, ensure the value and quality of program deliverables and follow up of projects within the programs, and maximize program contribution to the investment portfolio.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want the program to acquire and resources, in order to accomplish the goals and benefits of the program as defined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: BAI01.06&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-23" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-25" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-8" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-23" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2060.5" y="2038" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2120.5" y="2038" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-26" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-23" target="5n0gASPAGLLi4WL7JSeG-15" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2420.5" y="2038" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2480.5" y="2038" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-39" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-42" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-40" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2420" y="1948" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2480" y="1948" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-40" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO06.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Create and maintain budgets." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="1938" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4710" y="3410" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-41" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Prepare a budget reflecting investment priorities based on the portfolio&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;of I&amp;amp;T-enabled programs and I&amp;amp;T services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Foster a partnership between IT and enterprise stakeholders to enable the effective and efficient use of I&amp;amp;T-related resources and provide transparency and accountability of the cost and business value of solutions and services. Enable the enterprise to make informed decisions regarding the use of I&amp;amp;T solutions and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want a budget which reflects the investment priorities, in order to strategically allocate resources effectively.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO06.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-40" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-42" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO06.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Prioritize resource allocation." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2470" y="1938" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4350" y="3410" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-43" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Implement a decision-making process to prioritize the allocation of&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;resources and establish rules for discretionary investments by individual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;business units. Include the potential use of external service providers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and consider the buy, develop and rent options.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Foster a partnership between IT and enterprise stakeholders to enable the effective and efficient use of I&amp;amp;T-related resources and provide transparency and accountability of the cost and business value of solutions and services. Enable the enterprise to make informed decisions regarding the use of I&amp;amp;T solutions and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want the agile project team to implement clear decision-making processes to allocate resources, in order to establish a transparent and traceable process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO06.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-42" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-44" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO06.04&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Model and allocate costs." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1938" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5062.5" y="2880" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-45" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and use an I&amp;amp;T costing model based, for example, on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;service definition. This approach ensures that allocation of costs for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;services is identifiable, measurable and predictable, and encourages&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;the responsible use of resources, including those provided by service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;providers. Regularly review and benchmark the cost/chargeback model&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;to maintain its relevance and appropriateness for evolving business and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;IT activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Foster a partnership between IT and enterprise stakeholders to enable the effective and efficient use of I&amp;amp;T-related resources and provide transparency and accountability of the cost and business value of solutions and services. Enable the enterprise to make informed decisions regarding the use of I&amp;amp;T solutions and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want costs to be clearly assigned, in order to make costs identifiable, measureable and rpedictable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO06.05&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-44" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-46" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO06.05&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Manage costs." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1938" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3410" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-47" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Implement a cost management process that compares actual costs&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;against budget. Costs should be monitored and reported. Deviations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;from budget should be identified in a timely manner and their impact on&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;enterprise processes and services assessed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Foster a partnership between IT and enterprise stakeholders to enable the effective and efficient use of I&amp;amp;T-related resources and provide transparency and accountability of the cost and business value of solutions and services. Enable the enterprise to make informed decisions regarding the use of I&amp;amp;T solutions and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want to be well informed on the budget consumption and any deviations, in order to be able to react on deviations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-46" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-48" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-40" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-44" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3130" y="1938" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3190" y="1938" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-49" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-44" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-46" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3140" y="1948" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3200" y="1948" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-34" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO03.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Develop the enterprise architecture vision." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1848" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3990" y="3320" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-35" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The architecture vision provides a first-cut, high-level description of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;baseline and target architectures, covering the business, information,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;data, application and technology domains. The architecture vision&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;provides the sponsor with a key tool to sell the benefits of the proposed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;capabilities to stakeholders within the enterprise. The architecture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;vision describes how the new capabilities (in line with I&amp;amp;T strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and objectives) will meet enterprise goals and strategic objectives and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;address stakeholder concerns when implemented.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Represent the different building blocks that make up the enterprise and its interrelationships as well as the principles guiding their design and&amp;nbsp;evolution over time, to enable a standard, responsive and efficient delivery of operational and strategic objectives.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management board, I want the agile project team to develop for their epics an architectural vision, high-level baseline and target architecture, so that the architectural design follows a clear vision.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO03.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-34" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-7" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-16" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-14" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2030" y="1948" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2080" y="1898" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-8" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-14" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-12" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2410" y="1758" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2410" y="1708" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-9" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-12" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-10" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2420" y="1768" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2480" y="1768" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-10" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO02.04&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Conduct a gap analysis." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="1758" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4710" y="3230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-11" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Identify gaps between current and target environments and describe the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;high-level changes in the enterprise architecture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Support the digital transformation strategy of the organization and deliver the desired value through a road map of incremental changes. Use a&amp;nbsp;holistic I&amp;amp;T approach, ensuring that each initiative is clearly connected to an overarching strategy. Enable change in all different aspects of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization, from channels and processes to data, culture, skills, operating model and incentives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a stakeholder of the company, I want the agile project team to identify gaps between the current and the target environment products and services, in order to describe the high-level change in their epics.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO02.05&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-12" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO02.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Define target digital capabilities." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2470" y="1758" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4350" y="3230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-13" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Based on the understanding of enterprise context and direction, define&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;the target I&amp;amp;T products and services and required capabilities. Consider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;reference standards, best practices and validated emerging technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Support the digital transformation strategy of the organization and deliver the desired value through a road map of incremental changes. Use a&amp;nbsp;holistic I&amp;amp;T approach, ensuring that each initiative is clearly connected to an overarching strategy. Enable change in all different aspects of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization, from channels and processes to data, culture, skills, operating model and incentives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a stakeholder of the company, I want the agile project team to define target products and services, in order to define epics meeting those set targets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO02.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-12" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-14" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO02.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Assess current capabilities, performance and digital&lt;div&gt;maturity of the enterprise.&lt;/div&gt;" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2110" y="1758" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3990" y="3230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-15" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Assess the performance of current I&amp;amp;T services and develop an&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;understanding of current business and I&amp;amp;T capabilities (both internal&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and external). Assess current digital maturity of the enterprise and its&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;appetite for change.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Support the digital transformation strategy of the organization and deliver the desired value through a road map of incremental changes. Use a&amp;nbsp;holistic I&amp;amp;T approach, ensuring that each initiative is clearly connected to an overarching strategy. Enable change in all different aspects of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization, from channels and processes to data, culture, skills, operating model and incentives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a stakeholder of the company, I want the agile project team to gain an understanding of the current services an capabilities, so that they can develop epics based on the current digital maturity and its appetite for change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO02.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-14" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-16" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO02.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Design the management system for enterprise I&amp;amp;T." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="1758" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3630" y="3230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-17" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Understand the enterprise context (industry drivers, relevant regulations,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;basis for competition), its current way of working and its ambition level&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;in terms of digitization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Support the digital transformation strategy of the organization and deliver the desired value through a road map of incremental changes. Use a&amp;nbsp;holistic I&amp;amp;T approach, ensuring that each initiative is clearly connected to an overarching strategy. Enable change in all different aspects of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization, from channels and processes to data, culture, skills, operating model and incentives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a stakeholder of the company, I want the agile project team to understand the enterprises context, so that they can develop epics that meet all contextual requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO02.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-18" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO02.05&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Define the strategic plan and road map." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1758" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5062.5" y="2700" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-19" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Develop a holistic digital strategy, in cooperation with relevant&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;stakeholders, and detail a road map that defines the incremental steps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;required to achieve the goals and objectives. Ensure focus on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;transformation journey through the appointment of a person who helps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;spearhead the digital transformation and drives alignment between&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;business and I&amp;amp;T.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Support the digital transformation strategy of the organization and deliver the desired value through a road map of incremental changes. Use a&amp;nbsp;holistic I&amp;amp;T approach, ensuring that each initiative is clearly connected to an overarching strategy. Enable change in all different aspects of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization, from channels and processes to data, culture, skills, operating model and incentives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a stakeholder of the company, I want the agile project team to define a incremental road map with incremental steps in the format of epics as well as appointing persons, in order to implement the target environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: APO02.06&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-18" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-20" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - APO02.06&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Monitor value optimization." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1758" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3230" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-21" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Create awareness and understanding of the business and I&amp;amp;T objectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and direction, as captured in the I&amp;amp;T strategy, through communication to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;appropriate stakeholders and users throughout the enterprise.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Support the digital transformation strategy of the organization and deliver the desired value through a road map of incremental changes. Use a&amp;nbsp;holistic I&amp;amp;T approach, ensuring that each initiative is clearly connected to an overarching strategy. Enable change in all different aspects of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;organization, from channels and processes to data, culture, skills, operating model and incentives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a stakeholder of the company, I want a project team that is informed about the strategy, in order create awareness and understanding.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-20" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-22" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-10" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-18" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3130" y="1758" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3190" y="1758" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-23" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-18" target="sbHoc3gWJixWeE4EDV6L-20" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3140" y="1768" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3200" y="1768" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-2" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM05.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Direct stakeholder engagement, communication and reporting." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1668" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3140" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-3" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ensure the establishment of effective stakeholder involvement,&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;communication and reporting, including mechanisms for ensuring the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;quality and completeness of information, overseeing mandatory reporting,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and creating a communication strategy for stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Ensure that stakeholders are supportive of the I&amp;amp;T strategy and road map, communication to stakeholders is effective and timely, and the basis for&amp;nbsp;reporting is established to increase performance. Identify areas for improvement, and confirm that I&amp;amp;T-related objectives and strategies are in line&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;with the enterprise’s strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As stakeholder of the company, I want to have engagement, communication and reporting mechanisms established, so that effective and timely reporting of the projects activities is guaranteed in an adequate quality.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM05.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-4" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM05.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Evaluate stakeholder engagement and reporting requirements." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1668" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4710" y="3370" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-5" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Continually examine and evaluate current and future requirements for&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;stakeholder engagement and reporting (including reporting mandated&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;by regulatory requirements), and communication to other stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Establish principles for engaging and communicating with stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ensure that stakeholders are supportive of the I&amp;amp;T strategy and road map, communication to stakeholders is effective and timely, and the basis for&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;reporting is established to increase performance. Identify areas for improvement, and confirm that I&amp;amp;T-related objectives and strategies are in line&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;with the enterprise’s strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As stakeholder of the company, I want to have engagement and reporting requirements established, so that effective and timely reporting of the projects activities is guaranteed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM05.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-6" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-4" target="oq3tbu96vJauZoKgjfeR-2" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3490" y="1668" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3550" y="1668" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-33" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-35" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-37" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="4020" y="1838" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="4070" y="1788" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-37" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM04.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Direct resource management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1578" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3050" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-38" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Ensure the adoption of resource management principles to enable optimal use of business and I&amp;amp;T resources throughout their full economic life cycle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Ensure that the resource needs of the enterprise are met in the optimal manner, I&amp;amp;T costs are optimized, and there is an increased likelihood of benefit realization and readiness for future change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management board, I want to make sure resource management principles are ensured; so that responsibilities, alignment processes and metrics are established.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM04.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-37" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-35" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM04.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Evaluate resource management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1578" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5070" y="3050" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-36" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Continually examine and evaluate the current and future need for business and I&amp;amp;T resources (financial and human), options for resourcing (including sourcing strategies), and allocation and management principles to meet the needs of the enterprise in the optimal manner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Ensure that the resource needs of the enterprise are met in the optimal manner, I&amp;amp;T costs are optimized, and there is an increased likelihood of benefit realization and readiness for future change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management board, I want to make sure that all resource requirements of agile initiatives are continually examined and evaluated, so that lacking resources (financial and human) are prevented.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM04.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-35" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-28" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-24" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-26" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3110" y="1668" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3160" y="1618" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-31" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-26" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-29" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3490" y="2788" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3517.5" y="1528" as="targetPoint" />
            <Array as="points" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-29" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM03.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Monitor risk management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3547.5" y="1478" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6560" y="2490" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-30" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Monitor the key goals and metrics of the risk management processes. Determine how deviations or problems will be identified, tracked and reported for remediation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want metrics of risks (e.g. KRIs) to be established by agile projects, so that deviations or problems can be detected and remediated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-29" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-24" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM03.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Evaluate risk management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="1478" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5070" y="3190" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-25" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Continually examine and evaluate the effect of risk on the current and future use of I&amp;amp;T in the enterprise. Consider whether the enterprise’s risk appetite is appropriate and ensure that risk to enterprise value related to the use of I&amp;amp;T is identified and managed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want risks within agile projects to be evaluated, so that the enterprise&#39;s risk appetite is not exceeded.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM03.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-24" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-26" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM03.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Direct risk management." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1478" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3190" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-27" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Direct the establishment of risk management practices to provide reasonable assurance that I&amp;amp;T risk management practices are appropriate and that actual I&amp;amp;T risk does not exceed the board’s risk appetite.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want risk management practices to be applied, so that the enterprise&#39;s risk appetite is not exceeded.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM03.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-26" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-16" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-12" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-14" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="2750" y="1578" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2800" y="1528" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-19" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-14" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-17" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3130" y="1388" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3130" y="1338" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-22" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-17" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-20" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3140" y="1398" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3200" y="1398" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-20" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM02.04&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Monitor value optimization." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1388" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3090" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-21" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Monitor key goals and metrics to determine whether the enterprise receives expected value and benefit from I&amp;amp;T-enabled investments and services. Identify significant issues and consider corrective actions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want financial investments to be monitored and corrective measures are initiated, so that value is realized in an optimal manner in course of the whole epic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-20" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-17" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM02.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Direct value optimization." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1388" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5070" y="3090" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-18" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Direct value management principles and practices to enable optimal value realization from I&amp;amp;T-enabled investments throughout their full economic life cycle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want financial investments to be managed in a diligent manner, so that value is realized in the enterprises interest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM02.04&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-17" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-14" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM02.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Evaluate value optimization." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="1388" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4710" y="3090" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-15" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Continually evaluate the portfolio of I&amp;amp;T-enabled investments, services and assets to determine the likelihood of achieving enterprise objectives and delivering value. Identify and evaluate any changes in direction to management that will optimize value creation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want investments to be evaluated on their suitability, so that enterprise objectives are met and value is delivered in the most optimized manner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM02.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-14" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-12" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM02.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Establish the target investment mix." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2470" y="1388" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4350" y="3090" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-13" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Review and ensure clarity of the enterprise and I&amp;amp;T strategies and current services. Define an appropriate investment mix based on cost, alignment with strategy, type of benefit for the programs in the portfolio, degree of risk, and financial measures such as cost and expected return on investment (ROI) over the full economic life cycle. Adjust the enterprise and I&amp;amp;T strategies where necessary.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Secure optimal value from I&amp;amp;T-enabled initiatives, services and assets; cost-efficient delivery of solutions and services; and a reliable and accurate picture of costs and likely benefits so that business needs are supported effectively and efficiently.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want investments within agile projects to be aligned with the enterprises strategy, so that new financial resources are facilitated in an optimized manner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM02.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-12" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-2" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="nE-EjzNcMq43JnrIoQBQ-26" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-3" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="3660" y="1538" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="3710" y="1488" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-3" target="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-6" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="3530" y="1278" />
              <mxPoint x="3530" y="1278" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nE-EjzNcMq43JnrIoQBQ-26" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM01.01&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Evaluate the governance system." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2830" y="1278" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4710" y="2750" width="360" height="390" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nE-EjzNcMq43JnrIoQBQ-37" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Continually identify and engage with the enterprise’s stakeholders, document an understanding of the requirements, and evaluate the current and future design of governance of enterprise I&amp;amp;T.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Provide a consistent approach integrated and aligned with the enterprise governance approach. I&amp;amp;T-related decisions are made in line with the enterprise’s strategies and objectives and desired value is realized. To that end, ensure that I&amp;amp;T-related processes are overseen effectively and transparently; compliance with legal, contractual and regulatory requirements is confirmed; and the governance requirements for board members are met.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want to make sure that agile initiatives are in compliance with the governance system as well as in alignment with the enterprise&#39;s strategy, so that new developments align with the companies goals and governance principles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM01.02&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nE-EjzNcMq43JnrIoQBQ-26" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM01.02&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Direct the governance system." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3190" y="1278" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5070" y="2980" width="360" height="400" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Inform leaders on I&amp;amp;T governance principles and obtain their support, buy-in and commitment. Guide the structures, processes and practices for the governance of I&amp;amp;T in line with the agreed governance principles, decision-making models and authority levels. Define the information required for informed decision making.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Provide a consistent approach integrated and aligned with the enterprise governance approach. I&amp;amp;T-related decisions are made in line with the enterprise’s strategies and objectives and desired value is realized. To that end, ensure that I&amp;amp;T-related processes are overseen effectively and transparently; compliance with legal, contractual and regulatory requirements is confirmed; and the governance requirements for board members are met.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want leaders to support the governance principles, so that a compliance to these principles is ensured by increased awareness.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: EDM01.03&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-6" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;COBIT 2019 - EDM01.03&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Monitor the governance system." style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3550" y="1278" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="2980" width="360" height="400" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-7" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Monitor the effectiveness and performance of the enterprise’s governance of I&amp;amp;T. Assess whether the governance system and implemented mechanisms (including structures, principles and processes) are operating effectively and provide appropriate oversight of I&amp;amp;T to enable value creation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Provide a consistent approach integrated and aligned with the enterprise governance approach. I&amp;amp;T-related decisions are made in line with the enterprise’s strategies and objectives and desired value is realized. To that end, ensure that I&amp;amp;T-related processes are overseen effectively and transparently; compliance with legal, contractual and regulatory requirements is confirmed; and the governance requirements for board members are met.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an enterprise&#39;s stakeholder, I want the governance system and mechanisms to be assessed within agile projects, so that a compliance to these principles is ensured and operational effectiveness is given.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="izNcHli7krDH618Io2Hl-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-6" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Service Validation and Testing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Optimize%20response%2C%20identify%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Promote%20and%20empower%20usage%20of%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20across%20the%20organization%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20application%20and%20initiate%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20On-demand%20information%20discovery%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Optimize%20response%2C%20identify%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Promote%20and%20empower%20usage%20of%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20across%20the%20organization%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20application%20and%20initiate%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20On-demand%20information%20discovery%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%&lt;/span&gt;(3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Testing approach and models management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4979.25" y="2448" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6550.5" y="4610" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-7" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Testing strategy definition and review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Testing standards definition and review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Test models definition and review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service validation and testing practice is to ensure that new or changed products and services meet defined requirements. The definition of service value is based on input from customers, business objectives, and regulatory requirements and is documented as part of the design and transition value chain activity. These inputs are used to establish measurable quality and performance indicators that support the definition of assurance criteria and testing requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to develop a testing strategy and model, in order to make the quality and the objective fulfillment test- and measurable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Service Validation and Testing (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-7" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 6.6&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Confidentiality or non-disclosure agreements" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.25" y="2450" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428.75" y="4060" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-8" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Confidentiality or non-disclosure agreements reflecting the organization’s needs for the protection of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;information should be identified, documented, regularly reviewed and signed by personnel and other&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;relevant interested parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To maintain confidentiality of information accessible by personnel or external parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure that confidentiality and/or non-disclosure agreements are tailored and signed by the project personnel, in order to maintain confidentiality of enterprise information.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-24" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 15.5&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Assess Service Providers" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6800" y="2448" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6800" y="2448" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-25" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Assess service providers consistent with the enterprise’s service provider management policy. Assessment scope may vary based on classification(s), and may include review of standardized assessment reports, such as Service Organization Control 2 (SOC 2) and Payment Card Industry (PCI) Attestation of Compliance (AoC), customized questionnaires, or other appropriately rigorous processes. Reassess service providers annually, at a minimum, or with new and renewed contracts.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;In our modern, connected world, enterprises rely on vendors and partners to help manage their data or rely on infrastructure for core applications or functions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to onboard used service providers to the organization&#39;s assessment process of service providers, in order to have them covered according to the organization&#39;s practices.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-24" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-41" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 18.1&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Establish and Maintain a Penetration Testing Program" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="7160" y="2448" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="7160" y="2448" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-42" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain a penetration testing program appropriate to the size, complexity, industry, and maturity of the enterprise. Penetration testing program characteristics include scope, such as network, web application, Application Programming Interface (API), hosted services, and physical premise controls; frequency; limitations, such as acceptable hours, and excluded attack types; point of contact information; remediation, such as how findings will be routed internally; and retrospective requirements.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;Penetration testing starts with the reconnaissance of the enterprise and environment, and scanning to identify the vulnerabilities that can be used as entries into the enterprise.&amp;nbsp;Vulnerabilities will be identified in these targets. Exploits to these vulnerabilities are executed to demonstrate how an adversary would attack.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to participate and inform the penetration testing program in order to onboard the developed solution, in order to assure an adequate coverage.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-41" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-16" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Service continuity management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Governance of service continuity management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4980.5" y="2358" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="3991.75" y="6180" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-17" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Scope definition&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Policy setting&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Awareness and exercise programme development&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service continuity management practice is to ensure that the availability and performance of a service are maintained at sufficient levels in case of a disaster.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to be aware over governance mechanisms regarding service continuity management, in order to consider those aspects already in the development process or at least preliminary to the release.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Service continuity management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-5" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 6.5&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Responsibilities after termination or change of employment" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.25" y="2360" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428.75" y="3970" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-6" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Information security responsibilities and duties that remain valid after termination or change of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;employment should be defined, enforced and communicated to relevant personnel and other interested&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;parties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To protect the organization’s interests as part of the process of changing or terminating employment or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;contracts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to assure that Information security responsibilities remain valid after termination of project personnel, in order to protect the organization&#39;s interest after terminating employment or contracts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-22" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 15.4&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Ensure Service Provider Contracts Include Security Requirements" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6800" y="2359" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6800" y="2359" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-23" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Ensure service provider contracts include security requirements. Example requirements may include minimum security program requirements, security incident and/or data breach notification and response, data encryption requirements, and data disposal commitments. These security requirements must be consistent with the enterprise’s service provider management policy. Review service provider contracts annually to ensure contracts are not missing security requirements.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;In our modern, connected world, enterprises rely on vendors and partners to help manage their data or rely on infrastructure for core applications or functions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to assure that contracts with service providers include security requirements, in order to have a contractually agreed security level.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-22" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-38" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 17.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Establish and Maintain Security Incident Thresholds" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="7160" y="2359" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="7160" y="2359" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-39" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain security incident thresholds, including, at a minimum, differentiating between an incident and an event. Examples can include: abnormal activity, security vulnerability, security weakness, data breach, privacy incident, etc. Review annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;The primary goal of incident response is to identify threats on the enterprise, respond to them before they can spread, and remediate them before they can cause harm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to use and maintain security incident thresholds, in order to assure that thresholds are in line with business priorities and comparable between all applications.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-38" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-9" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Service configuration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Optimize%20response%2C%20identify%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Promote%20and%20empower%20usage%20of%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20across%20the%20organization%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20application%20and%20initiate%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20On-demand%20information%20discovery%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Optimize%20response%2C%20identify%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Promote%20and%20empower%20usage%20of%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20across%20the%20organization%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20application%20and%20initiate%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20On-demand%20information%20discovery%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;management (3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Managing a common approach to service configuration management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4979.25" y="2268" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="4710.5" y="2620" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-10" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse stakeholder requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Define and agree the service configuration management approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Communicate and integrate the service configuration management approach into the organization&#39;s value streams&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review and adjust the service configuration management approach and procedures&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service configuration management practice is to ensure that accurate and reliable information about the configuration of services, and the configuration items that support them, is available when and where it is needed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects be familiar with the service configuration management practice, in order to follow it correctly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Service configuration management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="x0tNCmZjMzLHtTbmIZVQ-9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-3" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 6.4&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Disciplinary process" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.25" y="2270" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428.75" y="3880" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;A disciplinary process should be formalized and communicated to take actions against personnel and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;other relevant interested parties who have committed an information security policy violation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure personnel and other relevant interested parties understand the consequences of information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;security policy violation, to deter and appropriately deal with personnel and other relevant interested&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;parties who committed the violation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to apply disciplinary processes in case of security policy violations, in order to deter and appropriately deal with project personnel committing violations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-20" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 15.3&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Classify Service Providers" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6800" y="2268" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6800" y="2268" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-21" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Classify service providers. Classification consideration may include one or more characteristics, such as data sensitivity, data volume, availability requirements, applicable regulations, inherent risk, and mitigated risk. Update and review classifications annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;In our modern, connected world, enterprises rely on vendors and partners to help manage their data or rely on infrastructure for core applications or functions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to classify the service providers used in the project according to the organization&#39;s methodology, in order to assure an organization-wide consistent classification of service providers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-20" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-34" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 17.7&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Conduct Routine Incident Response Exercises" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="7160" y="2268" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="7160" y="2268" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-35" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Plan and conduct routine incident response exercises and scenarios for key personnel involved in the incident response process to prepare for responding to real-world incidents. Exercises need to test communication channels, decision making, and workflows. Conduct testing on an annual basis, at a minimum.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;The primary goal of incident response is to identify threats on the enterprise, respond to them before they can spread, and remediate them before they can cause harm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to assure that incident response exercises for the solution in project scope are planned and conducted, in order to assess the defined routines on feasibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-34" vertex="1">
