        <mxCell id="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-7" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse the organization and requirements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Develop and agree business analysis approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review the business analysis approach&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the business analysis practice is to analyse a part of the entirety of a business, define its needs, and recommend solutions to address these needs and/or solve a business problem. The solutions must facilitate value creation for the stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to orient their activity strongly on the organization&#39;s needs and analysis the context diligently, in order to meet business requirements and create value.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Business analysis management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="-aGxGEo2_JWixX-oLaSN-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-1" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 6.3&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Information security awareness, education and training" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5390" y="2180" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5427.5" y="3790" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Personnel of the organization and relevant interested parties should receive appropriate information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;security awareness, education and training and regular updates of the organization&#39;s information&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;security policy, topic-specific policies and procedures, as relevant for their job function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure personnel and relevant interested parties are aware of and fulfil their information security&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;responsibilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to setup appropriate and specific awareness campaigns and training programs on information security, in order properly educate the personnel and raise awareness among them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ZFYketriOgI-VsJBwGQb-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-18" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 15.2&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Establish and Maintain a Service Provider Management Policy" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6800" y="2179" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6800" y="2179" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-19" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain a service provider management policy. Ensure the policy addresses the classification, inventory, assessment, monitoring, and decommissioning of service providers. Review and update the policy annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;In our modern, connected world, enterprises rely on vendors and partners to help manage their data or rely on infrastructure for core applications or functions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to comply with the requirements stipulated by the service provider management policy, in order to assure an organization-wide consistent approach on managing service providers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-18" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-32" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 17.6&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Define Mechanisms for Communicating During Incident Response" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="7160" y="2178" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="7160" y="2178" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-33" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Determine which primary and secondary mechanisms will be used to communicate and report during a security incident. Mechanisms can include phone calls, emails, secure chat, or notification letters. Keep in mind that certain mechanisms, such as emails, can be affected during a security incident. Review annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;The primary goal of incident response is to identify threats on the enterprise, respond to them before they can spread, and remediate them before they can cause harm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to assure that mechanisms for communication during incident response are sufficient for the solution in project scope, in order to have reliable communication channels.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-32" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-6" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Supplier management&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(3.2.1)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Managing a common approach to supplier management" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#A680B8;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4980.5" y="2088" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5070.5" y="2530" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-7" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Develop and agree the sourcing strategy&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Develop and agree the supplier management procedures&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Communicate and embed the sourcing strategy and procedures&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review and adjust the sourcing strategy and procedures&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the supplier management practice is to ensure that the organization&#39;s suppliers and their performances are managed appropriately to support the seamless provision of quality products and services.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to follow the organization&#39;s approach to manage suppliers, in order to align with the overall enterprise framework or at least follow similarly diligent processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Supplier management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="UwG0B5D9gC1XuE7l1oR9-6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lKY83h3VUr54mTaQdPDG-1" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 6.2&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Terms and conditions of employment" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5391.25" y="2090" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428.75" y="3700" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lKY83h3VUr54mTaQdPDG-2" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The employment contractual agreements should state the personnel’s and the organization’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;responsibilities for information security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure personnel understand their information security responsibilities for the roles for which they&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;are considered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to setup contractual agreements for personnel that includes personnel&#39;s and organization&#39;s responsibilities for information security, in order to ensure proper understanding of they responsibilities for their role and their responsibility in protecting information is established an contractually agreed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="lKY83h3VUr54mTaQdPDG-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-16" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 15.1&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Establish and Maintain an Inventory of Service Providers" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6800" y="2089" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6800" y="2089" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-17" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain an inventory of service providers. The inventory is to list all known service providers, include classification(s), and designate an enterprise contact for each service provider. Review and update the inventory annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;In our modern, connected world, enterprises rely on vendors and partners to help manage their data or rely on infrastructure for core applications or functions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to maintain information of service providers used in the project in the organization&#39;s inventory, in order to maintain an accurate overview over the organization&#39;s service providers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-16" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-30" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 17.5&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Assign Key Roles and Responsibilities" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="7160" y="2088" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="7160" y="2088" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-31" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Assign key roles and responsibilities for incident response, including staff from incident responders, analysts, and relevant third parties. Review annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;The primary goal of incident response is to identify threats on the enterprise, respond to them before they can spread, and remediate them before they can cause harm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to assure that key roles and responsibilities are defined for handling all incident scenarios for the developed solution, in order to have necessary resources ready.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-30" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-10" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Optimize%20response%2C%20identify%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Promote%20and%20empower%20usage%20of%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20across%20the%20organization%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20application%20and%20initiate%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3