        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-11" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Strategic assessment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Strategy planning&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Strategy discussion and approval&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Strategy communication and implementation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Strategy review&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the strategy management practice is to formulate the goals of the organization and adopt the courses of action and allocation of resources necessary for achieving the goals. Strategy management establishes the organization&#39;s direction, focuses effort, defines or clarifies the organization&#39;s priorities, and provides consistency or guidance in response to the environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, want agile solution development projects to follow and enrich the organization&#39;s strategy, in order to assure meeting the organization&#39;s goals.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: Strategy management (3.2.2)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d92KtVC5V3nbnXYVr4gW-5" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 6.1&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Screening" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5392.5" y="2000" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5430" y="3610" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d92KtVC5V3nbnXYVr4gW-6" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Background verification checks on all candidates to become personnel should be carried out prior to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;joining the organization and on an ongoing basis taking into consideration applicable laws, regulations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;and ethics and be proportional to the business requirements, the classification of the information to be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;accessed and the perceived risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To ensure all personnel are eligible and suitable for the roles for which they are considered and remain&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;eligible and suitable during their employment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to participate in the organizations screening process for new personnel working in the project, in order to ensure eligibility and suitability of all personnel in the project.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="d92KtVC5V3nbnXYVr4gW-5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-27" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ISO 27001 &amp;amp; 27002 - 8.34&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Protection of information systems during audit testing" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="5751.25" y="2000" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="5428.75" y="4870" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-28" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Audit tests and other assurance activities involving assessment of operational systems should be&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;planned and agreed between the tester and appropriate management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;To minimize the impact of audit and other assurance activities on operational systems and business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to plan and agree audit tests and assurance activities involving assessment of operational systems, in order to minimize the impact of audit and other assurance activities on operational systems and business processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="3NLvPx2ckS6_KmLze-8x-27" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-13" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 14.9&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Conduct Role-Specific Security Awareness and Skills Training" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="6800" y="1999" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="6800" y="1999" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-14" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Conduct role-specific security awareness and skills training. Example implementations include secure system administration courses for IT professionals, OWASP® Top 10 vulnerability awareness and prevention training for web application developers, and advanced social engineering awareness training for high-profile roles.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;The actions of people play a critical part in the success or failure of an enterprise’s security program. It is easier for an attacker to entice a user to click a link or open an email attachment to install malware in order to get into an enterprise, than to find a network exploit to do it directly.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to assure role-specific security awareness and skills training for the project team as well as future operators, in order to assure tailored trainings for different groups.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="ibRm7NSeTpzZEgZbGgji-13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-28" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;CIS CSC - 17.4&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  Establish and Maintain an Incident Response Process" style="swimlane;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;startSize=60;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1" collapsed="1">
          <mxGeometry x="7160" y="1999" width="300" height="60" as="geometry">
            <mxRectangle x="7160" y="1999" width="360" height="410" as="alternateBounds" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-29" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain a documented incident response process that addresses roles and responsibilities, compliance requirements, and a communication plan. Review annually, or when significant enterprise changes occur that could impact this Safeguard.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;The primary goal of incident response is to identify threats on the enterprise, respond to them before they can spread, and remediate them before they can cause harm.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the organization, I want agile solution development projects to review the incident response process regarding applicability and feasibility for the developed solution and adapt where necessary, in order to save time in the incident handling due to accurate process steps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="j14fxGzRAlY_bbs1dScx-28" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="60" width="360" height="350" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nVK2YNMN3wv4ctxS4OYY-2" value="&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ITIL 4 - Service financial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.1)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%20Establishing%20and%20maintaining%20the%20knowledge%20management%20environment%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%224713%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%223%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Understand%20current%20culture%20of%20knowledge%20usage%20and%20knowledge%20sharing%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20external%20and%20internal%20requirements%20and%20factors%20of%20influence%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Optimize%20response%2C%20identify%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Promote%20and%20empower%20usage%20of%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20across%20the%20organization%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Review%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20application%20and%20initiate%20improvements%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20background-color%3A%20initial%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20contribute%20to%20a%20well%20established%20knowledge%20management%20environment%2C%20in%20order%20to%20maintain%20solution%2Fproduct%2Fproject%20knowledge%20in%20a%20manner%20that%20fits%20to%20the%20enterprise.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%20Knowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%222%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%224%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%20-%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%20font-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%20management%20(3.2.2)%26lt%3B%2Fi%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20On-demand%20information%20discovery%22%20style%3D%22swimlane%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BstartSize%3D60%3BfillColor%3D%23E1D5E7%3BstrokeColor%3D%23A680B8%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20collapsed%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20x%3D%225433%22%20y%3D%221990%22%20width%3D%22300%22%20height%3D%2260%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxRectangle%20x%3D%225073%22%20y%3D%221720%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22410%22%20as%3D%22alternateBounds%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%225%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Description%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Registration%20of%20information%20request%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Research%20and%20data%20collection%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20processing%20and%20presentation%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Information%20acceptance%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B-%20Knowledge%20integration%20and%20review%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BControl%20Objective%3A%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3BThe%20purpose%20of%20the%20knowledge%20management%20practice%20is%20to%20maintain%20and%20improve%20the%20effective%2C%20efficient%2C%20and%20convenient%20use%20of%20information%20and%20knowledge%20across%20the%20organization.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bb%26gt%3BEnabler%20Story%3A%26lt%3B%2Fb%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3BAs%20management%20of%20the%20enterprise%2C%20I%20want%20agile%20solution%20development%20projects%20to%20follow%20and%20apply%20on-demand%20information%20discovery%20processes%20to%20be%20established%2C%20in%20order%20to%20explore%20and%20research%20new%20information%20in%20an%20adequate%20quality.%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bbr%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bfont%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bu%20style%3D%26quot%3Bborder-color%3A%20var(--border-color)%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BDirect%20Successor%26lt%3B%2Fu%26gt%3B%3A%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Ffont%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3BKnowledge%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-size%3A%2010px%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3Bmanagement%20(3.2.3)%26lt%3B%2Fspan%26gt%3B%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3BverticalAlign%3Dtop%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%224%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20y%3D%2260%22%20width%3D%22360%22%20height%3D%22350%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%226%22%20value%3D%22%22%20style%3D%22endArrow%3Dclassic%3Bhtml%3D1%3Brounded%3D0%3BentryX%3D0%3BentryY%3D0%3BentryDx%3D0%3BentryDy%3D0%3BexitX%3D1%3BexitY%3D0%3BexitDx%3D0%3BexitDy%3D0%3B%22%20edge%3D%221%22%20source%3D%222%22%20target%3D%224%22%20parent%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20width%3D%2250%22%20height%3D%2250%22%20relative%3D%221%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225023%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22sourcePoint%22%2F%3E%3CmxPoint%20x%3D%225083%22%20y%3D%222000%22%20as%3D%22targetPoint%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxGeometry%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; font-style: normal; text-wrap: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20value%3D%22%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26amp%3Bnbsp%3B%20%26lt%3Bspan%20style%3D%26quot%3Bfont-weight%3A%20400%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bi%26gt%3BITIL%204%2