        <mxCell id="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Service request records and reports analysis&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Service request model improvement initiation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Service request model update communication&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the service request management practice is to support the agreed quality of a service by handling all predefined, user-initiated service requests in an effective and user friendly manner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to review and optimize existing service requests based on the feedbacks given, in order to create more efficient and effective processes in handling user requets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="DO11c-6wLbNFiMZy8dLW-3" vertex="1">
