        <mxCell id="s-qbUJ5rrHLjZnUm8olo-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Control Description:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Analyse resources and identify IT assets&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Verify IT assets and lifecycle models&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Follow the lifecycle model&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Manage exceptions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Review the lifecycle&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Control Objective:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;The purpose of the IT asset management practice is to plan and manage the full lifecycle of all IT assets, to help the organization: maximize value, control costs, manage risks, support decision-making, meet regulatory and contractual requirements.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Enabler Story:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;As management of the enterprise, I want agile solution development projects to support the efforts of monitoring and event reviews, in order to make the monitoring and event management more efficient and effective.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Direct Successor&lt;/u&gt;: None&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="s-qbUJ5rrHLjZnUm8olo-3" vertex="1">
